<span style="font-size:14px">Differentiate is a library mod designed with an emphasis on automation and copyleft licensing. It is being developed for Eltrut &amp; Co. but can be used by anyone.</span>

Differentiate does not add anything on its own; however, it is required for the following mods:

- **[Lepton](https://modrinth.com/mod/lepton)**
- Addendum
- More Respawn Anchors
- ... & other mods by Eltrut & Co.!

Modders are free to use this in their projects. This coremod lacks a dedicated maven, so check out [this article](https://support.modrinth.com/en/articles/8801191-modrinth-maven) for how to add this to your development environment, or copy-paste the code below:


```
repositories {
    exclusiveContent {
        forRepository {
            maven {
                name = "Modrinth"
                url = "https://api.modrinth.com/maven"
            }
        }
        filter {
            includeGroup "maven.modrinth"
        }
    }
}

dependencies {
    modImplementation "maven.modrinth:differentiate:${differentiate_version}"
}
```

and then define the target version of Differentiate in your ```gradle.properties``` file.
 

